
 Proxmox Wi-Fi workstation
 ------------------------------------------------------------------
 Desktop     sudo systemctl start lightdm
             sudo systemctl stop lightdm
 Boot mode   sudo systemctl set-default multi-user.target    (CLI)
             sudo systemctl set-default graphical.target     (desktop)

 Web UI      https://10.255.0.1:8006 (on this machine)
             https://WIFI_IP:8006    (from another device)
 Remote      ssh USER@WIFI_IP
             RDP to WIFI_IP:3389     (if xrdp is installed)

 Wi-Fi       ip -br addr                     show current addresses
             nmcli device wifi list          scan for networks
             sudo nmtui                      add or edit networks
             nmcli connection show           list saved networks

 Guests      sudo qm list                    list VMs
             sudo pct list                   list containers
 Health      systemctl --failed              show failed services
             systemctl status wifi-nat       check guest NAT
             pveversion                      show Proxmox version
             sudo systemctl restart pve-cluster pvedaemon pveproxy

